<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Filemɔn Suran</para>
  <para style="toc3">PHM</para>
  <para style="toc1">Filemɔn</para>
  <para style="toc2">FLM</para>
  <para style="mt1">Filemɔn</para>
  <para style="mt2">Pɔli ka Alla la Kuma Mɛn Nawa Filemɔn Ma</para>
  <para style="ip">Filemɔn ka kɛ lemɛniya mɔɔ bɛrɛ le ri. Tumado, a tɛrɛ Kɔlɔsi so lemɛniya jama le rɔ. Talibidenba Pɔli teri le tɛrɛ a ri (kuma diya 1). Jɔn do tɛrɛ a bolo, mɛn tɔɔ Onesimɔ, mɛn ka a bori a tii ma. An tɛ a lɔn ko Onesimɔ ni Pɔli ye ii ɲɔɔn lɔnna ɲa mɛn ma, baa Pɔli le tɛrɛ ye kaso la. Kɔni Onesimɔ fanan kɛni lemɛniya mɔɔ ri. Pɔli ka a latɛɛ a ye a lasɛ a tii ma, a ka kitabu ɲin sɛbɛ mɛn ma, ka a lamira a wara, kɔni a kana a mira jɔn borini ri, kɔni ikomin a badenma lemɛniya rɔ. Jɔn mɛn ka a bori a tii ma, wo ka ɲakanta ten a gbɛlɛn na.</para>
  <para style="ip">A ban kɔrɔ Filemɔn ni a kɔfɛbila mɔɔilu tuwala (kuma diya 1 haan 3), Pɔli ka baraka bila Alla yɛ Filemɔn ma lemɛniya ni a wakali la ko rɔ (kuma diya 4 haan 7). A ka madiyali lɔ Onesimɔ la ko rɔ, mɛn ye wala a tii tɔrɔfɛ (kuma diya 8 haan 22). Kitabu yɔrɔ ɲin banni tuwaliilu le fɛ, an ye mɔɔ siyaman tɔɔ yenna a kɔndɔ, mɛnilu ye Pɔli la kitabu sɛbɛnin kɔndɔ a ka mɛn nawa Kɔlɔsikailu ma (Kɔlɔsikailu suran 4 kuma diya 10,12,14 Arikipe fanan tɔɔ sɛbɛni kuma diya filana rɔ Kitabu yɔrɔ ɲin ka ii ni Kɔlɔsikailu suran 4 kuma diya 17). Tumado Onesimɔ wara kitabu filailu ri Kɔlɔsi so kɔndɔ Kɔlɔsikailu ma a ni Filemɔn ma.</para>
  <para style="ip">An ka Pɔli la ɲumaya yen ten Kitabu yɔrɔ ɲin kɔndɔ. A ka ɲin sɛbɛ a teri Filemɔn ma, kɔni a ma jamari si di a ma, a ma a diyagboya foyi ma, a ma a sariyailu bɔ a bolo Onesimɔ kun na. Kɔni a ka a labila a ma ten, a ni mɛnilu bɛɛ ye Kitabu yɔrɔ ɲin karanna, ka fɔ ko Alla la kaninteya ri mɔɔilu kɛɲa yɛlɛman ten.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1" />
  <para style="s">Tuwaliilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1" />Nde Pɔli mɛn kɛnin kasoden di Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin na ko rɔ, an ni badenma Timote le ka ɲin sɛbɛ an kaninte ni an baaraɲɔɔ Filemɔn ma, <verse eid="PHM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2" />a ni Apiya an mamuso a ni Arikipe an kɛlɛkɛɲɔɔ a ni lemɛniya jama mɛnilu ye ii ladɛnna i wara.<verse eid="PHM 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3" />An Fa Alla ni Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin ye hina ni jususuma di ai ma.<verse eid="PHM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filemɔn na kaninteya ni a la lemɛniya la ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4" />Filemɔn, n wa kɛ n na Alla matarala i la ko rɔ waati si, n di baraka bila a yɛ i la ko rɔ, <verse eid="PHM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5" />ka a masɔrɔn n da a lamɛn ko i lemɛniyani Maari Isa ma ɲa mɛn ma, i ra a la jama sɛniman bɛɛ kanin fanan. <verse eid="PHM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6" />N ye Alla matarala kosa badenmaya mɛn farani i la lemɛniya la, wo ye a kɛ i ye koɲuma bɛɛ lɔn kosɛbɛ, an ka mɛnilu sɔrɔn Ɲenematɔmɔnin baraka rɔ. <verse eid="PHM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7" />Badenma, i la kaninteya ra sɛwa ba di n ma, ka n nalemɛniya, baa i ra jama sɛniman bɛɛ nii ladiya ii ma.<verse eid="PHM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔli ka Filemɔn madiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8" />Wo le rɔ, hali n di se susula i jamarila Ɲenematɔmɔnin dɔ ko i ye ko kɛ mɛn dahani, <verse eid="PHM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9" />kɔni n ye i madiyala kaninteya le rɔ, nde Pɔli cɛmɔɔba, a ni sisɛn kasoden Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin na ko rɔ. <verse eid="PHM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10" />Wo rɔ, n ye i madiyala n den Onesimɔ la ko rɔ, mɛn kɛnin n den di kaso la. <verse eid="PHM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11" />A tɔnɔ tɛrɛ tɛ i ma waati taminni rɔ, kɔni sisɛn, a tɔnɔ ri kɛ an bɛɛ ma.<verse eid="PHM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12" />N ye a lasɛla i ma sisɛn, ale mɛn duman n yɛ ikomin n jɛrɛ nii. <verse eid="PHM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13" />A tɛrɛ duman n yɛ, ka a to n tɔrɔfɛ yan, kosa a ye baara n yɛ i nɔ rɔ, n ye kaso la waati mɛn na Isa la ko Kibaro Ɲuma la ko rɔ. <verse eid="PHM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14" />Kɔni n tɛ a fɛ ka foyi kɛ, ka fara i sawo la, kosa i la baara ɲuma kana kɛ diyagboya ri, kɔni a ye kɛ i ɲɛnikɛ la.<verse eid="PHM 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15" />Tumado, Onesimɔ mataanin i la le waatinin, kosa i ye a sɔrɔn ikɔ tuun habadan, <verse eid="PHM 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16" />adon jɔn gbansan tɛ a ri butun, kɔni a ra tamin jɔn na, a ra kɛ i diyanan badenma ri. A duman nde yɛ, kɔni a ye diya ile yɛ ka tamin nde la adamadenya rɔ a ni Maari rɔ.<verse eid="PHM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17" />Wo rɔ, ni i ka n jate i baaradenɲɔɔ ri, i ye Onesimɔ fanan ramira ikomin i ka n damira ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="PHM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18" />Ni a ka telenbaliya kɛ i la, wala ni a ka kan ka fen do lasɛ i ma, wo donin la nde kun ma. <verse eid="PHM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19" />Nde jɛrɛ le ka ɲin sɛbɛ n bolo la, nde Pɔli. N di i bolo ɲɔɔ lasɛ, kɔni n tɛ a fɛ ka a fɔ i yɛ ko ile ka kan ka i nii don n bolo. <verse eid="PHM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20" />N badenma, jaandi wo koɲuma kɛ n yɛ Maari la ko rɔ, n nii ladiya n ma Ɲenematɔmɔnin baraka rɔ.<verse eid="PHM 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21" />Baa n lani i la ko i ri n kan mira, n ye ɲin sɛbɛla i ma. N ka a lɔn i ri do kɛ ka tamin n na kuma la. <verse eid="PHM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22" />I ye jiya bon do fanan dabɛn n ɲɛrɔ ka a masɔrɔn n lani a la, n di n kɔsɛ ai ma ai la Alla matara baraka rɔ.<verse eid="PHM 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tuwali tɔilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23" />Epafirasi mɛn ye n tɔrɔfɛ kaso la Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin na ko rɔ, wo ye i tuwala. <verse eid="PHM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24" />N baaradenɲɔɔ doilu Marika ni Arisitariki ni Demasi ni Luka, woilu bɛɛ ye i tuwala.<verse eid="PHM 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25" />Alla ye a kɛ Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin na hina ye to ai nii rɔ.<verse eid="PHM 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1" />
</usx>